          "definition": "Greater or greatest in size, importance, rank, age, or comparative standing.",
          "usage_conditions": "Used in comparative and superlative constructions, including الْحَجِّ الْأَكْبَرِ and اللَّهُ أَكْبَرُ; in the latter, the expression conveys that God is greater than every other being or thing, or the Greatest absolutely.",
